-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_19__ssec_1_19/p8 Source: the Committee of Four's summary of 27.9.95 and a Director-General's special circular.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_19__ssec_1_19/p9 Source: the Committee of Four's summary of 27.6.02.
